					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "*Moved the VSStudy model and example classes to package {{gtClass:VISSOFT}} (with `Model` and `Examples` tags). {{gtClass:VISSOFT2026Slideshow}} remains in `GtVissoft2026`.*\n\n*During the move, {{gtClass:VSPaperGroup}} lost inherited collection-side behavior because it is no longer in the extension-bearing package; I restored its required local construction, access, enumeration, and testing behavior. All 45 relevant examples now pass.*"
